#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:100
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:101
msgid ""
"**Brand/System split**: HashiCorp Sans for headings and brand-critical "
"text; system-ui for body, navigation, and functional text. The brand font"
" carries the weight, system-ui carries the words."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:102
msgid ""
"**Kern always on**: All HashiCorp Sans text enables OpenType `\"kern\"` —"
" letterfitting is non-negotiable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:103
msgid ""
"**Tight headings**: Every heading uses 1.17–1.21 line-height, creating "
"dense, stacked text blocks that feel infrastructural — solid, load-"
"bearing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:104
msgid ""
"**Relaxed body**: Body text uses 1.50–1.69 line-height (notably "
"generous), creating comfortable reading rhythm beneath the dense "
"headings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:105
msgid ""
"**Uppercase labels as wayfinding**: 13px uppercase with 1.3px letter-"
"spacing serves as the systematic category/section marker — always "
"HashiCorp Sans weight 600."
msgstr ""

