#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:225
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Shadow Philosophy**: HashiCorp uses arguably the subtlest shadow system"
" in modern web design. The dual-layer shadows at 5% opacity are nearly "
"invisible — they exist not to create visual depth but to signal "
"interactivity. If you can see the shadow, it's too strong. This restraint"
" communicates the enterprise value of stability — nothing floats, nothing"
" is uncertain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:227
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:229
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:230
msgid ""
"Use HashiCorp Sans for headings and brand text, system-ui for body and UI"
" text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:231
msgid "Enable `\"kern\"` on all HashiCorp Sans text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:232
msgid ""
"Use product brand colors ONLY for their respective products (Terraform = "
"purple, Vault = yellow, etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:233
msgid ""
"Apply uppercase labels at 13px weight 600 with 1.3px letter-spacing for "
"section markers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:234
msgid "Keep shadows at the \"whisper\" level (0.05 opacity dual-layer)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:235
msgid "Use the `--mds-color-*` token system for consistent color application"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:236
msgid ""
"Maintain the tight-heading / relaxed-body rhythm (1.17–1.21 vs 1.50–1.69 "
"line-heights)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:237
msgid "Use `3px solid` focus outlines for accessibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:239
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:240
msgid ""
"Don't use product brand colors outside their product context (no "
"Terraform purple on Vault content)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:241
msgid "Don't increase shadow opacity above 0.1 — the whisper level is intentional"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:242
msgid ""
"Don't use pill-shaped buttons (>8px radius) — the sharp, minimal radius "
"is structural"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:243
msgid "Don't skip the `\"kern\"` feature on headings — the font requires it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:244
msgid ""
"Don't use HashiCorp Sans for small body text — it's designed for 17px+ "
"heading use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:245
msgid ""
"Don't mix product colors in the same component — each product has one "
"color"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:246
msgid ""
"Don't use pure black (`#000000`) for dark backgrounds — use `#15181e` or "
"`#0d0e12`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_hashicorp.md:247
msgid ""
"Don't forget the asymmetric button padding — 9px 9px 9px 15px is "
"intentional"
msgstr ""

